# Project TITAN V2.0 — Menu & Workflow Architecture (PM 최종 승인)

**Purpose:** List 중심 → **Task(업무) 중심** 전환 — 한 화면 = 한 업무

**SSoT (code):** `src/config/titanV20MenuWorkflowArchitecture.js`  
**SSoT (docs):** `docs/TITAN_V20_MENU_WORKFLOW_ARCHITECTURE.md`

**Status:** ✅ Architecture PM 승인 · ✅ Blueprint Architecture Final · 🔄 **HOME Blueprint Review 진행**

> ⚠️ Vision Roadmap V2.0 (Smart QR · Mobile)과 **별개** — 본 Rule = Menu & Workflow only

